# NCL-style Resource Compatibility

| Group | Resource | Status | File | Notes |
|---|---|---:|---|---|
| ContourPlot | `cnFillOn` | yes | `_contour.py` | Turn filled contour/raster field on or off. |
| ContourPlot | `cnFillMode` | partial | `_contour.py` | Supports AreaFill, RasterFill, CellFill, PcolorFill, Pcolormesh. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLinesOn` | yes | `_contour.py` | Draw contour lines. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineLabelsOn` | yes | `_contour.py` | Draw contour line labels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLevelSelectionMode` | partial | `_resources.py` | Supports ExplicitLevels, ManualLevels, EqualSpacedLevels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLevels` | yes | `_resources.py` | Explicit contour levels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnMinLevelValF` | yes | `_resources.py` | Minimum value for ManualLevels / EqualSpacedLevels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnMaxLevelValF` | yes | `_resources.py` | Maximum value for ManualLevels / EqualSpacedLevels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLevelSpacingF` | yes | `_resources.py` | Contour level spacing for ManualLevels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnFillPalette` | yes | `_colors.py` | Matplotlib colormap name or packaged .rgb colormap. |
| ContourPlot | `cnFillColors` | yes | `_contour.py` | Explicit fill color list. |
| ContourPlot | `cnFillExtendMode` | yes | `_contour.py` | Supports both, neither, min, max. |
| ContourPlot | `cnMissingValFillColor` | yes | `_contour.py` | Color for missing values. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineColor` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Single contour line color. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineColors` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Contour line color list. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineThicknessF` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Single contour line thickness. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineThicknesses` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Contour line thickness list. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineDashPattern` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Single contour dash pattern. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineDashPatterns` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Contour dash pattern list. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineLabelInterval` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Label every N contour levels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnLineLabelBackgroundColor` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Background box color for line labels. |
| ContourPlot | `cnSmoothingOn` | partial | `_contour.py` | Gaussian smoothing via scipy.ndimage. |
