| ContourPlot | `cnConstFLabelOn` | yes | `_contour.py` | Label constant fields. |
| ContourPlot | `cnInfoLabelOn` | partial | `_contour.py` | Simple min/max info label. |
| ContourPlot | `cnCellFillEdgeColor` | yes | `_contour.py` | Cell edge color for pcolormesh-like fill modes. |
| MapPlot | `mpProjection` | partial | `_maps.py` | Supports PlateCarree, Stereographic, Orthographic, Robinson, Mollweide, Mercator, LambertConformal, Albers. |
| MapPlot | `mpCenterLonF` | yes | `_maps.py` | Projection center longitude. |
| MapPlot | `mpCenterLatF` | yes | `_maps.py` | Projection center latitude. |
| MapPlot | `mpMinLonF / mpMaxLonF / mpMinLatF / mpMaxLatF` | yes | `_maps.py` | Lat/lon extent control. |
| MapPlot | `mpLimitMode` | partial | `_maps.py` | Supports LatLon / Corners style extent. |
| MapPlot | `mpFillOn` | yes | `_maps.py` | Enable land/ocean/inland water fill. |
| MapPlot | `mpLandFillColor` | yes | `_maps.py` | Land fill color. |
| MapPlot | `mpOceanFillColor` | yes | `_maps.py` | Ocean fill color. |
| MapPlot | `mpInlandWaterFillColor` | yes | `_maps.py` | Lake/inland water fill color. |
| MapPlot | `mpOutlineOn` | yes | `_maps.py` | Draw coastlines. |
| MapPlot | `mpNationalLineOn` | yes | `_maps.py` | Draw national borders. |
| MapPlot | `mpGridAndLimbOn` | yes | `_maps.py` | Draw gridlines. |
| MapPlot | `mpGridLabelsOn` | yes | `_maps.py / _tickmark.py` | Draw gridline labels. |
| MapPlot | `mpGridSpacingF / mpGridLonSpacingF / mpGridLatSpacingF` | yes | `_tickmark.py` | Gridline spacing. |
| MapPlot | `mpPerimOn` | partial | `_maps.py` | Map perimeter visibility. |
