| LabelBar | `pmLabelBarSide` | yes | `_labelbar.py` | Position labelbar on bottom/top/left/right. |
| LabelBar | `pmLabelBarWidthF / pmLabelBarHeightF` | yes | `_labelbar.py` | Manual labelbar size. |
| LabelBar | `pmLabelBarOrthogonalPosF / pmLabelBarParallelPosF` | partial | `_labelbar.py` | Manual offset from plot axes. |
| Panel | `gsnPanelMainString` | yes | `_panel.py` | Panel main title. |
| Panel | `gsnPanelFigureStrings` | yes | `_panel.py` | Panel labels like (a), (b), ... |
| Panel | `gsnPanelRowTitles / gsnPanelColTitles` | yes | `_panel.py` | Panel row/column titles. |
| Panel | `gsnPanelLeft / Right / Top / Bottom` | yes | `_panel.py` | Manual panel layout bounds. |
| Panel | `gsnPanelXWhiteSpacePercent / gsnPanelYWhiteSpacePercent` | yes | `_panel.py` | Panel spacing controls. |
| Panel | `gsnPanelLabelBar` | yes | `_panel.py` | Shared panel labelbar. |
| GSN | `gsnLeftString / gsnCenterString / gsnRightString` | yes | `_strings.py` | NCL-style left/center/right plot strings. |
| GSN | `gsnAddCyclic` | yes | `_contour.py / _overlay.py` | Add cyclic longitude point. |
| GSN | `gsnFrame` | partial | `_contour.py / _workstation.py` | Save figure if filename is supplied; workstation frame also supported. |
| Overlay | `overlay_contour` | yes | `_overlay.py` | Contour overlay. |
| Overlay | `overlay_filled_contour / overlay_pcolormesh` | yes | `_overlay.py` | Filled field overlay. |
| Overlay | `overlay_vectors` | yes | `_overlay.py` | Vector/quiver overlay. |
| Overlay | `overlay_markers / overlay_text` | yes | `_overlay.py` | Marker and text annotations. |
| Overlay | `overlay_polyline / polygon / rectangle` | yes | `_overlay.py` | Geometric annotation overlays. |
| Overlay | `add_hatching / add_stipple` | yes | `_hatching.py` | Hatch and stipple masks. |
| TickMark | `tmXBOn / tmXTOn / tmYLOn / tmYROn` | yes | `_tickmark.py` | Bottom/top/left/right tick label controls. |
| TickMark | `tmXBLabelFontHeightF / tmYLLabelFontHeightF` | yes | `_tickmark.py` | Tick label size. |
| TickMark | `tmXBValues / tmYLValues` | partial | `_tickmark.py` | Custom tick/grid values. |
| Workstation | `gsn_open_wks` | yes | `_workstation.py` | NCL-style workstation object. |
| Workstation | `frame / ncl_frame` | yes | `_workstation.py` | Save a frame with automatic frame numbering. |
| Objects | `ScalarField` | yes | `_objects.py` | Python object inspired by NCL scalarFieldClass. |
| Objects | `ContourMapPlot / PanelMapPlot / MapPlot` | yes | `_objects.py` | Object-oriented plotting workflow. |

## v0.3.1 Panel / LabelBar / TickMark

This development step focuses on NCL-style panel, labelbar, and tickmark behavior.

## Panel

New or improved resources:

- `gsnPanelAutoTickLabels`
- `gsnPanelLeftLabelsOn`
- `gsnPanelRightLabelsOn`
- `gsnPanelBottomLabelsOn`
- `gsnPanelTopLabelsOn`
- `gsnPanelLabelBarSide`
- `gsnPanelLabelBarOrientation`
- `gsnPanelLabelBarWidthF`
- `gsnPanelLabelBarHeightF`
- `gsnPanelLabelBarOrthogonalPosF`
- `gsnPanelLabelBarParallelPosF`

The default panel behavior now hides interior tick/grid labels and keeps only the outer labels. This is closer to the practical NCL panel style and makes dense multi-panel maps cleaner.

## LabelBar

The shared panel labelbar can now be positioned relative to the full panel box. It supports bottom, top, left, and right side placement through `gsnPanelLabelBarSide`, while retaining explicit manual placement through `gsnPanelLabelBarLeft`, `gsnPanelLabelBarBottom`, `gsnPanelLabelBarWidth`, and `gsnPanelLabelBarHeight`.

## TickMark

Tick label controls are now more complete for all four sides:

- `tmXBLabelsOn`
- `tmXTLabelsOn`
- `tmYLLabelsOn`
- `tmYRLabelsOn`
- `tmXTLabelFontHeightF`
- `tmYRLabelFontHeightF`
- `tmXTLabelFontColor`
- `tmYRLabelFontColor`
- `tmLabelClipOn`

`tmLabelClipOn` is enabled by default to reduce tick-label overflow around panel edges.

